635
00:35:57.322 --> 00:36:00.200
Ito ay isang marangal na ginamit
upang magbigay ng paggalang sa mga abogado.

636
00:36:02.786 --> 00:36:06.081
Kung nais mong tukuyin bilang ganoon,
kumilos tayo nang naaayon.

637
00:36:06.956 --> 00:36:07.999
- Oo, ginoo.
- Oo, ginoo.

638
00:36:16.341 --> 00:36:17.300
Jeez...

639
00:36:20.887 --> 00:36:27.310
MANOK NA PINAPAPUNO NG KAHOY

640
00:36:47.247 --> 00:36:48.873
Mi-yeon! Seo-yeon!

641
00:36:48.957 --> 00:36:50.375
- Ho-yeon!
