642
00:36:51.292 --> 00:36:54.504
Siguradong gutom na gutom ka na. Hulaan mo kung ano ito.

643
00:36:54.587 --> 00:36:56.881
- Wow, manok!
- Wow, manok!

644
00:36:56.965 --> 00:36:59.300
