651
00:37:26.453 --> 00:37:29.956
Nag-post kami ng netong kita
ng 3.1 bilyong won para sa panahon.

652
00:37:31.082 --> 00:37:32.333
Tulad ng nakikita mo…

653
00:37:35.837 --> 00:37:37.380
COMPREHENSIVE INCOME
CASH FLOW STATEMENT

