695
00:40:08.156 --> 00:40:09.407
Hindi, hindi iyon.

696
00:40:09.490 --> 00:40:11.826
Naramdaman ko lang ang isang uri ng tradisyonal na vibe.

697
00:40:11.910 --> 00:40:14.078
Oo, ito ay nasa loob ng 30 taon.

698
00:40:14.162 --> 00:40:16.289
- Ganoon ba?
- Oo.

699
00:40:16.372 --> 00:40:18.041
